{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "council_id": "p36-calibration-tournament",
  "participation": "agent_only",
  "objective": {
    "statement": "Stop weighting every seat equally regardless of whether it has ever been right: every verdict carries a confidence band, outcomes are recorded, and seat weights move with realised accuracy - with seats below the floor demoted to advisory.",
    "charter": "The only protocol in the catalogue with MEMORY ACROSS COUNCILS. It changes the WEIGHTS over time rather than the round structure, which is exactly why it ships in SHADOW: a bad weight silently distorts every later council.",
    "risk_tier": "high",
    "desired_output": "review_verdict",
    "success_criteria": [
      "no verdict was accepted without a confidence band",
      "every outcome was recorded with the n it contributes to",
      "no weight left 1.0 while any seat had fewer than 20 resolutions or kappa at or below 0.6"
    ],
    "consensus_intent": "adjudicate",
    "confidence_target": 0.85,
    "evidence_requirements": {
      "citation_required": true,
      "anchor_style": "any",
      "min_independent_sources": 2,
      "evidence_outranks_votes": true
    }
  },
  "participants": {
    "selection": {
      "mode": "exact",
      "strategies": [
        "exact",
        "calibration_ranked",
        "vendor_diverse",
        "model_diverse"
      ],
      "explain_choices": true,
      "owner_override_allowed": true
    },
    "count": {
      "mode": "exact",
      "exact_n": 6
    },
    "diversity": {
      "min_distinct_vendors": 2,
      "min_distinct_expertise": 3,
      "max_share_per_vendor": 0.6
    },
    "roster": [
      {
        "participant_id": "graded-seat-a",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "domain_expert",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "the decision domain"
        ],
        "vote_weight": 1.0
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "graded-seat-b",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "gpt-5-codex",
        "vendor": "openai",
        "role": "domain_expert",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "the decision domain"
        ],
        "vote_weight": 1.0
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "graded-seat-c",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "critic",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "adversarial review"
        ],
        "vote_weight": 1.0
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "graded-seat-d",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "gpt-5-codex",
        "vendor": "openai",
        "role": "forecaster",
        "authority": "voter",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "estimation"
        ],
        "vote_weight": 1.0
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "calibrator",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "calibrator",
        "authority": "judge",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "kappa",
          "Brier scoring",
          "weight governance"
        ],
        "rights": {
          "may_speak": true,
          "may_vote": false
        },
        "context": {
          "briefing": "SHADOW MODE. Record every band and outcome. Hold every weight at 1.0 until a seat has at least 20 resolutions AND kappa against the owner's own corrections exceeds 0.6. Disclose n on every report."
        }
      },
      {
        "participant_id": "demotion-clerk",
        "kind": "agent",
        "model": "opus-5",
        "vendor": "anthropic",
        "role": "verifier",
        "authority": "contributor",
        "effort": "high",
        "independence": {
          "sees_peers_before_first_position": true,
          "fresh_context": false
        },
        "expertise": [
          "policy enforcement"
        ],
        "rights": {
          "may_speak": true,
          "may_vote": false
        },
        "context": {
          "briefing": "A seat below the accuracy floor is demoted to advisory and cannot carry a vote."
        }
      }
    ],
    "role_templates": [
      "domain_expert",
      "critic",
      "forecaster",
      "calibrator",
      "verifier"
    ],
    "replacement": {
      "enabled": true,
      "triggers": [
        "hallucinated_expertise",
        "inactivity",
        "policy_violation"
      ],
      "preserve_prior_positions": true
    },
    "conflicts_policy": {
      "disclosure_required": true,
      "on_conflict": "disclose_only"
    },
    "duplicate_detection": {
      "enabled": true,
      "dimensions": [
        "model",
        "vendor",
        "position_similarity"
      ],
      "max_similarity": 0.85
    }
  },
  "preparation": {
    "research_required": true,
    "independent_prep": true,
    "min_sources": 2,
    "required_artifacts": [
      "evidence_pack",
      "benchmark_baseline"
    ]
  },
  "topology": {
    "kind": "flat"
  },
  "protocol": {
    "sequence": [
      {
        "kind": "prediction_confidence",
        "stage_id": "banded-verdicts",
        "rounds": 1,
        "participants": [
          "graded-seat-a",
          "graded-seat-b",
          "graded-seat-c",
          "graded-seat-d"
        ],
        "independent": true,
        "quotas": {
          "novel_ideas_per_round": 1
        },
        "exit_when": {
          "metric": "custom:unbanded_verdicts",
          "op": "<=",
          "value": 0,
          "value_type": "number"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "custom",
        "custom_name": "outcome_resolution_recording",
        "stage_id": "record",
        "rounds": 1,
        "participants": [
          "calibrator"
        ],
        "exit_when": {
          "metric": "custom:outcomes_recorded",
          "op": ">=",
          "value": 1,
          "value_type": "number"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "custom",
        "custom_name": "weight_promotion_gate_shadow_until_proven",
        "stage_id": "promotion-gate",
        "rounds": 1,
        "participants": [
          "calibrator",
          "demotion-clerk"
        ],
        "exit_when": {
          "all_of": [
            {
              "metric": "custom:min_resolutions_per_seat",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 20,
              "value_type": "number"
            },
            {
              "metric": "custom:judge_owner_kappa",
              "op": ">=",
              "value": 0.6,
              "value_type": "number"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "synthesis",
        "stage_id": "verdict-and-scores"
      }
    ],
    "speaking_order": "lowest_confidence_first",
    "rounds": {
      "min": 1,
      "max": 3
    },
    "turn": {
      "max_words": 600
    },
    "obligations": {
      "must_respond_to_prior": true,
      "must_cite_evidence": true,
      "steelman_before_rebuttal": true,
      "rebuttal_required": true,
      "cross_examination": true,
      "declare_confidence": true,
      "declare_conflicts": true
    },
    "critique_intensity": "standard"
  },
  "budgets": {
    "effort": "high",
    "time_minutes": 45,
    "turns": 20,
    "min_engagement_turns": 2,
    "max_inactivity_rounds": 1,
    "rebuttal_depth": 2
  },
  "targets": {
    "unique_ideas": 4,
    "categories": 2,
    "novelty_ratio": 0.25,
    "evidence_items": 6,
    "dedup": {
      "enabled": true,
      "max_similarity": 0.85,
      "trivial_variant_policy": "flag_for_review"
    }
  },
  "voting": {
    "method": "weighted",
    "weights": {
      "graded-seat-a": 1.0,
      "graded-seat-b": 1.0,
      "graded-seat-c": 1.0,
      "graded-seat-d": 1.0
    },
    "belief_aggregation": {
      "method": "calibration_weighted",
      "require_confidence_per_vote": true,
      "calibration_source": "platform/council/state/p36-calibration-tournament/seat-scores.json"
    },
    "evidence_gate": {
      "votes_require_evidence": true,
      "evidence_outranks_majority": true,
      "reject_evidence_free_majority": true
    },
    "abstention": {
      "allowed": true,
      "counts_toward_quorum": false,
      "must_justify": true,
      "strategic_abstention_check": true
    },
    "tie_break": "owner"
  },
  "consensus": {
    "threshold": 0.7,
    "measure": "confidence_overlap",
    "minority_report": "required",
    "dissent_policy": {
      "preserve_verbatim": true,
      "attributed": true,
      "min_dissenters_to_block": 1,
      "suppression_check": true
    },
    "irreducible_disagreement_allowed": true,
    "fast_unanimity_is_suspicious": true
  },
  "stopping": {
    "source_expression": "ALL[custom:unbanded_verdicts <= 0, custom:outcomes_recorded >= 1, all_participants_spoke == true, custom:weights_pinned_until_proven == true]",
    "expression": {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "metric": "custom:unbanded_verdicts",
          "op": "<=",
          "value": 0,
          "value_type": "number"
        },
        {
          "metric": "custom:outcomes_recorded",
          "op": ">=",
          "value": 1,
          "value_type": "number"
        },
        {
          "metric": "all_participants_spoke",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true
        },
        {
          "metric": "custom:weights_pinned_until_proven",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true,
          "value_type": "boolean"
        }
      ]
    },
    "minimum_deliberation": {
      "min_rounds": 1,
      "min_independent_positions": 4,
      "every_participant_spoke": true,
      "min_evidence_items": 4
    },
    "hard_caps": {
      "max_rounds": 3,
      "max_minutes": 60,
      "on_cap": "conditional_decision"
    }
  },
  "outcomes": {
    "allowed": [
      "decision",
      "conditional_decision",
      "no_decision",
      "minority_report",
      "dissent"
    ],
    "conditional_decision_requires": [
      "the n behind every seat weight is disclosed with the verdict",
      "any weight that left 1.0 names the kappa and resolution count that authorised it"
    ]
  },
  "deadlock": {
    "detection": {
      "no_progress_rounds": 2,
      "repetition_similarity": 0.9,
      "vote_oscillation_rounds": 2
    },
    "resolution": [
      "blind_re_evaluation",
      "recruit_independent_critic",
      "escalate_to_owner",
      "declare_no_decision"
    ],
    "escalation": {
      "after_attempts": 2,
      "to": "owner"
    },
    "owner_intervention": {
      "allowed": true,
      "may_override_vote": true,
      "must_be_logged": true
    }
  },
  "anti_failure": {
    "controls": [
      "strategic_voting",
      "sycophancy",
      "evidence_free_majority",
      "hallucinated_expertise",
      "lost_dissent",
      "collusion",
      "premature_convergence"
    ],
    "fast_unanimity_response": [
      "blind_re_evaluation",
      "forced_dissent",
      "recruit_independent_critic"
    ],
    "injection_defense": {
      "treat_artifacts_as_data": true,
      "strip_instructions_from_participant_output": true,
      "quarantine_untrusted_sources": true
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "required": [
      "calibration_report",
      "confidence_trajectory",
      "votes_by_round",
      "dissent_minority_report",
      "evidence_map",
      "transcript",
      "final_recommendation",
      "decision_lineage"
    ],
    "receipt_schema": "platform/schema/receipt.schema.json"
  },
  "audit": {
    "transcript": true,
    "replay": true,
    "resume": true,
    "determinism": "seeded",
    "privacy": {
      "redact_secrets": true,
      "redaction_policy": "deny_by_default",
      "retain_days": 365,
      "pii_policy": "redact"
    },
    "safety": {
      "forbid_irreversible_actions": true,
      "owner_approval_for": [
        "moving any seat weight off 1.0",
        "demoting a seat to advisory",
        "resetting the calibration store"
      ]
    },
    "persistence": {
      "store": "both",
      "path": "platform/council/state/p36-calibration-tournament",
      "checkpoint_every_round": true
    },
    "calibration": {
      "post_run": true,
      "score": "brier"
    }
  },
  "metadata": {
    "title": "P36 calibration tournament (FORECASTING, SHADOW, OWNER-DECISION)",
    "owner": "Prekzursil",
    "spec_citations": [
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:685",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:690",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:696",
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md:697"
    ],
    "lineage": [
      "12-COUNCIL-PROTOCOLS-AND-PRESETS.md#P36 calibration-tournament"
    ],
    "notes": "ANTI-FAILURE DEFENCES (7 declared): (1) the card's failure mode is 'weights learned from too few resolutions', defended by the promotion-gate stage whose exit requires BOTH custom:min_resolutions_per_seat >= 20 AND custom:judge_owner_kappa >= 0.6, and by voting.weights being pinned at 1.0 for every seat right now - SHADOW is the shipped configuration, not a TODO; (2) strategic_voting and (3) collusion matter more here than anywhere else because a vote is a durable weight update, so strategic_abstention_check is on and duplicate_detection covers model AND vendor; (4) sycophancy is answered by speaking_order=lowest_confidence_first, which puts the least confident seat first so it cannot fold to a confident peer it has not heard yet; (5) evidence_free_majority is blocked by evidence_outranks_majority - a weighted vote with no evidence is the worst possible input to a memory system; (6) hallucinated_expertise is what the scoring is FOR, and it also triggers replacement; (7) lost_dissent is met by minority_report=required with suppression_check. FAST UNANIMITY: blind_re_evaluation first, because unanimity in a council that writes weights is self-reinforcing. HONEST LIMITS, INLINE: (a) the calibration store at platform/council/state/p36-calibration-tournament/seat-scores.json DOES NOT EXIST, so belief_aggregation.method=calibration_weighted currently degrades to equal weights - which is exactly what the pinned 1.0 weights already say; (b) custom:weights_pinned_until_proven is an assertion named in the lane's PRODUCERS map (platform/lib/council_protocols/_shared.py, republished in PROTOCOL-EXPECTATIONS-25-36.json) and NOT implemented, with no implementation, so today SHADOW mode is a declaration rather than an enforced invariant, and the settling experiment is the card's own - measure kappa against the owner's own corrections and require it above 0.6 before any weight moves; (c) the card marks this OWNER-DECISION: YES and conflicts-with P06 nominal-group-technique, which is equal-weight by design."
  }
}
